# Copy this file to .env only if you need to override something.
#
# Google Analytics 4 measurement id, in the form G-XXXXXXXXXX.
#
# You normally do not need to set this. Production builds already use the site's
# own property, and development deliberately tracks nothing so local work stays
# out of the reports.
#
# Set it if you are forking the project and want your own property instead.
#
# This is not a secret. It ships in the built page, which is why it carries
# Astro's PUBLIC_ prefix. Never put anything actually sensitive behind PUBLIC_.
PUBLIC_GA_ID=
